---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How HazirMinds collects, uses and protects personal information on hazirminds.ai, including forms, the website AI assistant, calls and texts. We don't sell your personal information.">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) clamp(24px,4vw,48px) clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Privacy Policy</span></nav>
<header style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:clamp(40px,6vw,64px)">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Legal</p>
<h1 style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;text-wrap:pretty">How we collect, use and protect personal information when you visit hazirminds.ai, contact us, book a call, or talk with the AI assistant on our website.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#585E5A"><span>Effective date: Oct 12, 2026</span></div>
</header>
<div style="display:flex;gap:clamp(40px,6vw,96px);align-items:flex-start">
<aside class="hide-lt960" style="flex:0 0 260px;position:sticky;top:104px;max-height:calc(100vh - 128px);overflow-y:auto"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A;padding:0 12px 8px">On this page</p>
<a class="x1" href="#p1" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">1. Who we are</a>
<a class="x2" href="#p2" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">2. Information we collect</a>
<a class="x3" href="#p3" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">3. How we use it</a>
<a class="x4" href="#p4" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">4. Cookies and analytics</a>
<a class="x5" href="#p5" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">5. How we share information</a>
<a class="x6" href="#p6" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">6. AI assistant on our website</a>
<a class="x7" href="#p7" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">7. Calls and text messages</a>
<a class="x8" href="#p8" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">8. How long we keep information</a>
<a class="x9" href="#p9" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">9. Security</a>
<a class="x10" href="#p10" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">10. Your choices and rights</a>
<a class="x11" href="#p11" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">11. Children</a>
<a class="x12" href="#p12" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">12. Changes to this policy</a>
<a class="x13" href="#p13" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">13. Contact us</a>
</nav></aside>
<article style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:48px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:12px;background:#E3EDE9"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">verified_user</span><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;color:#0B3A35">We don't sell your personal information.</p></div>

<section id="p1" aria-labelledby="p1-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p1-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">1. Who we are and what this policy covers</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Hazir Minds, LLC ("HazirMinds," "we," "us") is an AI solutions partner based in North Carolina, USA. This policy explains how we collect, use and protect personal information when you visit hazirminds.ai, contact us, book a call, or talk with the AI assistant on our website.</p>
<h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:8px">When we work for our clients</h3>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We build and run AI receptionists, websites, chat and messaging tools for businesses and organizations (our "clients"). When you call, text or chat with one of our clients through a system we run for them, that client decides how your information is used, and its own privacy policy applies. We process that information only on the client's behalf and under a written agreement with them. If you have questions about that information, please contact the business you were dealing with. We'll help them respond.</p>
</section>

<section id="p2" aria-labelledby="p2-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p2-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">2. Information we collect</h2>
<dl style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6">
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Contact and booking forms</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Name, business name, email, phone, role, and what you tell us about your needs</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Our website AI chat and voice assistant</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">What you type or say, contact details you share, and a transcript of the conversation</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Calls, emails and texts with us</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Your contact details, messages, and call notes or recordings where we tell you a call is recorded</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Automatically, when you browse</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">IP address, browser and device type, pages visited, referring site and approximate location (city or region), through cookies and similar tools</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">From others</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Contact details from people who refer you to us, or from our sales representatives who met you</dd></div>
</dl>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We don't ask for sensitive information such as health, financial account or government ID numbers through our website. Please don't share them in forms or chat.</p>
</section>

<section id="p3" aria-labelledby="p3-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p3-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">3. How we use it</h2>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">
<li>To answer your questions and schedule calls</li>
<li>To prepare proposals and provide services you ask for</li>
<li>To send you information you request, and occasional updates you can opt out of at any time</li>
<li>To run, secure and improve our website, including preventing spam and abuse</li>
<li>To comply with law and enforce our terms</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We don't use your website conversations or messages to train AI models that serve other companies.</p>
</section>

<section id="p4" aria-labelledby="p4-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p4-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">4. Cookies and analytics</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We use cookies that are needed for the website to work, and may use analytics tools to understand how visitors use the site, such as which pages are popular. <mark style="background:#F7ECD6;color:#7A4E00;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:600">[List tools in use, e.g. Google Analytics.]</mark> You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings; the site will still work, though some features may not. <mark style="background:#F7ECD6;color:#7A4E00;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:600">[If advertising pixels are added: describe them and offer an opt-out.]</mark></p>
</section>

<section id="p5" aria-labelledby="p5-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p5-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">5. How we share information</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We share personal information only:</p>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">
<li><b style="color:#1A211F">With service providers</b> that help us run our business, such as website hosting, email, scheduling, customer relationship management, telephony and AI processing. They may use it only to provide services to us, under contracts that require them to protect it.</li>
<li><b style="color:#1A211F">With our sales representatives</b>, who are bound by confidentiality, when they are helping you as a prospective client.</li>
<li><b style="color:#1A211F">For legal reasons</b>, when required by law, or to protect our rights, users or the public.</li>
<li><b style="color:#1A211F">In a business transfer</b>, if HazirMinds is involved in a merger or sale, under the same protections.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We don't sell or rent personal information, and we don't share it for cross-context advertising.</p>
</section>

<section id="p6" aria-labelledby="p6-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p6-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">6. AI assistant on our website</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Our website assistant is an AI, not a person. It answers from information we have approved and passes your request to our team when needed. Conversations are processed by our AI model providers under terms that don't allow them to use the content to train their models, and transcripts are stored in our systems so we can follow up. <a href="/ai-disclosure">How we use AI</a></p>
</section>

<section id="p7" aria-labelledby="p7-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p7-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">7. Calls and text messages</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">If you give us your phone number and agree to receive texts, we use it to reply to you and send related messages. Message frequency varies, and message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help. We don't sell or share your mobile number or text-messaging consent with third parties for their marketing.</p>
</section>

<section id="p8" aria-labelledby="p8-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p8-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">8. How long we keep information</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We keep prospect and contact information for as long as we have an active conversation with you and for up to 3 years after our last contact, unless you ask us to delete it sooner. Client records are kept for the length of our contract plus the time the law requires for tax and business records. Website analytics data is kept in summary form.</p>
</section>

<section id="p9" aria-labelledby="p9-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p9-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">9. Security</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We protect information with encryption in transit and at rest, access controls, multi-factor authentication and monitoring, and we host data in the United States. No system is perfectly secure, but we work to protect your information and will notify you if a breach affects you, as the law requires. <a href="/security">Security &amp; Trust</a></p>
</section>

<section id="p10" aria-labelledby="p10-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p10-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">10. Your choices and rights</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">You can ask us to:</p>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">
<li>Tell you what personal information we hold about you and give you a copy</li>
<li>Correct or delete it</li>
<li>Stop sending you marketing emails or texts</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under state law. We honor these requests for everyone, whatever state you live in. Email <a href="mailto:contact@hazirminds.ai?subject=Privacy%20request">contact@hazirminds.ai</a> with the subject "Privacy request." We'll confirm your identity and respond within 30 days. We won't treat you differently for making a request.</p>
</section>

<section id="p11" aria-labelledby="p11-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p11-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">11. Children</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Our website and services are for businesses and adults. We don't knowingly collect information from children under 13. If you think a child has given us information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>
</section>

<section id="p12" aria-labelledby="p12-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p12-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">12. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We may update this policy from time to time. We'll post the new version here with a new effective date, and tell you directly if the changes are significant.</p>
</section>

<section id="p13" aria-labelledby="p13-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="p13-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">13. Contact us</h2>
<address style="font-style:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Hazir Minds, LLC<br>North Carolina, USA<br><a href="mailto:contact@hazirminds.ai">contact@hazirminds.ai</a><br><a href="tel:+19199247608">919-924-7608</a></address>
</section>

<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:15px">Other legal pages</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;font-size:16px"><a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a><a href="/ai-disclosure">AI Disclosure</a><a href="/accessibility">Accessibility Statement</a><a href="/free-website-terms">Free Static Website Terms</a></div></div>
</article>
</div>
</div>

</Base>

